4824_515696533404825_1528446457997843684_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X3bdpooeBu8Q7kNvwEe5X1C&_nc_oc=AdpVjfzw4VOXMo-LLkk38IjvRdWXLwU4TFMZeJZ_RtUil-C7kDNp_zJpkc7K7rcM7fQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF770Kpk1zd6oGv1ZNkedxyXTyVvhTyEa24Maje1Mf4Fg&oe=6A92D122"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4Store.png", "id": "714944692850983", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031599_714944696184316_682281266916949772_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LzJ4LP9i1xUQ7kNvwGBlYTk&_nc_oc=Adq_vEKwCXVqSxLNRL7tUUuAkm7XSmJrSofsDPd63TbwI4R-oI-hL-KyQk6LfpxMBCI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFIC2oNksD2zuhIQ2vqoSQiGhyGNDbkifuxr4AgencrAg&oe=6A92D5CF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "LogoLayeredFullRes.png", "id": "717938162539078", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974798_717938165872411_4984458671277444646_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2wZST3JJYMgQ7kNvwGrOKVv&_nc_oc=AdpvaVrf_4RWPd_2QnTmy5imLG-3_HnqMar4KXLP4M8SjucKSuhiwIzd0ng7Gnw_edQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGqm-WuKvPrnrSHeQ_2_zFkVK9D001R50VCV54w4AeJMg&oe=6A92B2DD"}, "display_name": "Masternoid", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Masternoid is a pure arcade brick breaker, reimagined for the age of VR.\n\nImmerse yourself in a bright and colorful world, embrace the meditative power of destruction and ascend to the top of the leaderboards like a true arcade legend.\n\nYou can enjoy the game seated or standing, as minimal physical effort and space is required to play.\n\nYou only need one controller - right or left hand it is up to you - and one button to shoot and re-bounce the ball. ", "short_description": "Masternoid is a pure arcade brick breaker, reimagined for the age of VR.\n\nImmerse yourself in a bright and colorful world, embrace the meditative power of destruction and ascend to the top of